nifticlib
------------------------------------------
Niftilib is a set of i/o libraries for reading and writing files in the nifti-1
data format. nifti-1 is a binary file format for storing medical image data,
e.g. magnetic resonance image (MRI) and functional MRI (fMRI) brain images.

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.12-1
  libnifti2-3.0.1-1bl1
  libznz3-3.0.1-1bl1
  zlib0-1.4-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  binutils-2.47-1
  cmake-4.4.5-1
  cygport-0.37.12-1
  gcc-core-14.4.0-1
  ninja-1.13.2-1
  zlib-devel-1.4-1

Canonical website:
  https://github.com/NIFTI-Imaging/nifti_clib

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/NIFTI-Imaging/nifti_clib/archive/refs/tags/v3.0.1.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack nifticlib-3.0.1-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./nifticlib-3.0.1-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/nifticlib-3.0.1-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/nifticlib-3.0.1-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libnifti2-3.0.1-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libznz3-3.0.1-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libnifti-devel-3.0.1-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

Files included in the binary package:

(nifticlib)
  /usr/bin/nifti1_tool.exe
  /usr/bin/nifti_stats.exe
  /usr/bin/nifti_tool.exe
  /usr/share/doc/Cygwin/nifticlib.README
  /usr/share/doc/nifticlib/LICENSE
  /usr/share/doc/nifticlib/README.md
  /usr/share/doc/nifticlib/Updates.txt

(libnifti2)
  /usr/bin/cygnifti2-2.dll
  /usr/bin/cygnifticdf-2.dll
  /usr/bin/cygniftiio-2.dll

(libznz3)
  /usr/bin/cygznz-3.dll

(libnifti-devel)
  /usr/include/nifti/nifti1.h
  /usr/include/nifti/nifti1_io.h
  /usr/include/nifti/nifti2.h
  /usr/include/nifti/nifti2_io.h
  /usr/include/nifti/nifticdf.h
  /usr/include/nifti/znzlib.h
  /usr/lib/cmake/NIFTI/NIFTIConfig.cmake
  /usr/lib/cmake/NIFTI/NIFTIConfigVersion.cmake
  /usr/lib/cmake/NIFTI/NIFTITargets-relwithdebinfo.cmake
  /usr/lib/cmake/NIFTI/NIFTITargets.cmake
  /usr/lib/libnifti2.dll.a
  /usr/lib/libnifticdf.dll.a
  /usr/lib/libniftiio.dll.a
  /usr/lib/libznz.dll.a

